<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.52 vs   0.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.21 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.61 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Sales		   22.91 vs  16.45</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.45 vs  26.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.29 vs  41.44</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.86 vs  33.87</p>
<p> Sales		  247.15 vs 188.51</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
